 that  are running businesses will  sit at that table show up at that  meeting and contribute because that's  really how we fix what's wrong with this  country  yeah we need people who really know what  it's like to to you know  run a family and and have kids and and  pay bills  i'm running for office christy known  governor gnome it is such a pleasure to  have you on today i want to thank you so  much and i'm sure that you're inspiring  so many people who are watching right  now thank you oh  thank you rachel all right coming up  president
 

